{
  "name": "dsh-thinking-effort",
  "version": "0.5.1",
  "description": "多功能 DSH 插件：① 为 OpenAI 兼容第三方模型声明 Codex 风格推理档位并钉住默认档位；② 引用目录（附加文件夹）——为会话添加可读写的白名单文件夹，注册 refdir_list/read/write/edit/grep 工具。安装一次，按模块持续扩展。",
  "type": "module",
  "main": "index.js",
  "files": [
    "index.js",
    "client.js",
    "cordis.patch.yml",
    "README.md",
    "modules/"
  ],
  "exports": {
    ".": "./index.js",
    "./client": "./client.js",
    "./package.json": "./package.json"
  },
  "dsh": {
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    },
    "client": {
      "platform": "web"
    }
  }
}
